      <description><![CDATA[
<h3>Added</h3>
<ul>
<li>Settings: Stats page for local plan-utilization history charts.</li>
<li>Telemetry: optional self-hosted usage sample mirroring.</li>
<li>Menu: hover shows absolute reset time; reset timeline markers on quota bars.</li>
</ul>
<h3>Fixed</h3>
<ul>
<li>Telemetry: send plan-utilization samples on every refresh, even when history storage does not change (flat usage previously skipped the pipeline after the July 5 main merge).</li>
</ul>
      ]]></description>
